=== E1. One variable at a time: LP-IV of u(t+12) - u(t-1) on the month-t change in x_j, instrument NS ===
    beta_j = (response of u at 12) / (response of x_j in month t); every beta_j * psi_j equals the same number (the shock's total effect),
    so these 'effects' are inverse responses, i.e. market-type weights, not separate causal effects.
